# Used only by app/Dockerfile (build context is the repository root).
# The image copies just app/, db/ and scripts/ — allowlist those and keep
# local bytecode and env files out so they can't invalidate the COPY layers
# or leak into the image.
*
!app/
!db/
!scripts/
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.env
**/.env.*
